From daf5ae401e05179ef94450c3f340df0dedc46dfe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Manaflow contributors <https://github.com/manaflow-ai/cmux-browser>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] cmux: host native pinned toolbar actions in pane toolbars

Chromium 148-149 compatibility base. cmux panes own a real Browser but
intentionally do not create Chromium's mutually exclusive BrowserView. Add a
Browser-based constructor while preserving the existing BrowserView entry
point unchanged.

Chromium's original files and these modifications remain BSD-3-Clause. See
third_party/chromium/LICENSE and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

--- a/chrome/browser/ui/views/toolbar/pinned_toolbar_actions_container.h
+++ b/chrome/browser/ui/views/toolbar/pinned_toolbar_actions_container.h
@@ -18,8 +18,10 @@
 #include "ui/actions/action_id.h"
